cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "bayes-cot-faithfulness: Bayesian causal mediation for chain-of-thought faithfulness"
abstract: >-
  A Bayesian causal-mediation framework for measuring whether a language model chain-of-thought
  causes its answer. The reasoning is treated as a mediator, the prompt effect is split into a
  direct and an indirect path, and the result is a posterior over each path with a sensitivity
  sweep over hidden confounding.
authors:
